f-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids in Harmon County came in under 90% of normal in April to May and September to October in 40 of 75 years since 1951. In 2025 the middle ran 208% of normal in March to April and 20% in January to February. So far in 2026 the middle sits at 39% in February to March and 115% in June to July. Grid 17820 had its driest year in 1970 at 46% of normal.</p>"}
